# Enemy projectile (Spitter shot): dense sphere with a team-1 mini-field - PLAYER emitter fields
# brake and deflect it in flight (the force-ball mechanism, mirrored). Damages the structure it
# hits (contact hook in NpcSystem), ages out otherwise.
Prefab gameEnemyShot
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Sphere
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.85 0.4 1
		Scale 0.25
	Component Physics
		Body Dynamic
		Shape Sphere
		Radius 0.25
		Density 400
		Restitution 0.3
		ContactEvents true
	Component Force
		Team 1
		Output 0.4
		Reach 1.5
		Centered true
	Component Network
	Component GameProjectile
		UnitDamage 0
		StructureDamage 10
		Lifetime 6
		EmitterDrain 15
		EmitterDrainRadius 5
